#use(std/math: asciimath)

#toc

#section{Release Notes}{This release ships the #ref("plugins"){plugin system}
and a proper #ref("toc-anchor"). Complexity of the merge step stays
#m{O(n log n)}, and inline #code{#use} directives load each plugin.}

#section{Highlights}{The #def("plugins"){plugins}{self-contained host modules}
are now first class, and the #def("toc-anchor"){table of contents}{a generated
section index} links every heading.}

#section{Reference tables}::

Supported table shapes at a glance:

#ptable
	Shape    | Source   | Cells
	nested   | #table   | markup
	pipe     | #ptable  | plain text

A quick Racket sample:

#code(lang: "racket")
	(define (sq x) (* x x)) ; squares its arg
	(map sq '(1 2 3))

#glossary
